[SIZE=5]► Important Technical Notes[/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]Java 25+ Required:[/B] This plugin is built for the future of Minecraft and requires modern Java environments.
[*][B]Unique Server IDs:[/B] You [B]must[/B] set a unique `server-id` for each server (e.g., "lobby-1", "survival").
[*][B]Table Prefixing:[/B] Supports prefixing tables via `table-prefix: ""` for shared database environments.
[/LIST]
